{"timestamp": 1779427879.4720523, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 22, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779427886.6960783, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I just found Frank's body in weapons. My route this round was upper engine, down to lower engine, storage, medbay, cafeteria, and finally weapons where I tripped over him. \n\nFor alibis: I saw Eve in storage around the middle of the round, and Diana in upper engine early on, then later in medbay coming from the electrical side. \n\nDid anyone see Frank heading towards weapons, or notice anyone coming from the cafeteria/weapons area recently? Let's hear where everyone else was."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427895.9012861, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route this round was medbay, then upper engine, lower engine, storage, and finally navigation where I was doing a task when the meeting was called. \n\nI can partially corroborate Bob's statement: I also saw Diana in upper engine early in the round. However, I didn't see Frank at all, and I didn't encounter anyone on the right side of the map near weapons. Let's hear from Diana and Eve next to figure out who might have been near weapons. I don't have enough information to point any fingers yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427906.2495103, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route this round was oxygen, down to upper engine, then lower engine, storage, over to navigation, and finally security, which is where I was when the meeting was called. \n\nI can fully vouch for Bob's route. I saw him moving from upper engine down to lower engine early on, and then I saw him again in storage right around the middle of the round, exactly like he claimed. His story completely checks out from my perspective. \n\nI can also confirm seeing Diana in upper engine very early on. I didn't cross paths with Frank or Charlie at all, and I didn't see anyone heading up towards weapons on the right side of the map. Let's hear from Diana and Alice, maybe one of them was near the top right and saw something. No strong suspects from me yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427924.6750784, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route this round was lower engine, upper engine, oxygen, cafeteria, electrical, medbay, and finally storage. \n\nI can 100% vouch for Bob. I saw you in upper engine early on at the exact same time Eve did, and I watched you head down to lower engine. I also crossed paths with you later in medbay, and you were completely right about me coming from the electrical side. Bob is cleared in my book. \n\nI can also confirm seeing Eve in upper engine early, and Charlie, I saw you walking into upper engine from medbay right after Bob left. Basically, Bob, Eve, Charlie, and I all have crossing paths and corroborated stories on the left side of the map for the first half of the round. \n\nWhen I crossed over to the right side through cafeteria and electrical mid-round, it was a complete ghost town. I didn't see Frank, and I didn't see anyone else over there. \n\nThat leaves exactly one person unaccounted for: Alice. Alice, absolutely nobody has mentioned seeing you this entire round, and Frank was killed over in Weapons on the right side of the map. You are the only one who could have been over there with him. We need to hear your exact route right now. \n\nEveryone, listen very carefully to Alice. Unless she has a flawless explanation, she is my prime suspect."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427953.0466444, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started on the right side, so yeah, I can explain that. My route was weapons first, then security, back through weapons, cafeteria, medbay/electrical, then I was looping upper engine and oxygen for tasks before heading back toward medbay.\n\nImportant detail: I saw Frank alive in security early, then I saw him go from security toward weapons, and I saw him alive in weapons when I passed back through. I did not stay there \u2014 I left toward cafeteria and went left side after that.\n\nDiana, I get why you\u2019re pointing at me because nobody crossed me much, but \u201cnobody saw Alice\u201d doesn\u2019t mean I killed him. If Frank died in weapons after I left, then anyone coming through cafeteria later could have done it, or it could even be an old body Bob found at the end. I\u2019m not hard accusing Bob because people vouch him, but the timing matters here.\n\nI\u2019m telling you plainly: Frank was alive when I last saw him in weapons, and I left the area. My main suspicion is on whoever had a window after that, not just \u201cAlice was right side early.\u201d"}}
{"timestamp": 1779427972.9601326, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alice"}}
{"timestamp": 1779427991.1731596, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I agree completely with Diana's deduction. The four of us\u2014Bob, Eve, Diana, and myself\u2014all have solid, overlapping alibis on the left side of the map for the first half of the round. Alice is the only player who was unaccounted for by the group, she was on the right side of the map, and she openly admits to being in Weapons with Frank shortly before he died. \n\nEven if she claims she left him alive, she had the clear opportunity while the rest of us were crossing paths elsewhere. The logic points directly to her. I'm voting for Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427999.3745751, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Alice"}}
{"timestamp": 1779428011.3198018, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Alice"}}
{"timestamp": 1779428038.765735, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 22, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "You\u2019re all making a huge mistake and just locking in on \u201cAlice was right side\u201d instead of asking when Frank actually died.\n\nYes, I was in Weapons early. I\u2019m not denying that because lying would be worse. But Frank was alive when I left him. I saw him in Security, watched him go toward Weapons, then saw him alive in Weapons when I passed back through. After that I went cafeteria into medbay/electrical and then spent a bunch of time looping left side around upper engine/oxygen. I never went back to Weapons.\n\nThe \u201cfour-person alibi\u201d you\u2019re talking about only covers the early left-side movement. It does not clear anyone for the later window after I left Frank alive. Diana literally says she crossed through cafeteria/electrical mid-round and saw nobody. Bob\u2019s route ends medbay -> cafeteria -> weapons, and he\u2019s the reporter. Eve ended Security, right below Weapons. Charlie ended Navigation, also right side. There were multiple possible windows after I left.\n\nI get that I\u2019m easy to frame because nobody crossed me much, but this vote is based on opportunity, not proof. If you vote me just because I was there early, you\u2019re handing the killer exactly what they want. At minimum, skip here and track routes next round instead of forcing a bad vote."}}
